      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "11-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "第11题 1941年从猫薄荷植物中分离出来的荆芥内酯可用作安眠药,抗痉挛药,退热药等.通过荆芥内酯的氢化反应可以得到二氢荆芥内酯,后者是有效的驱虫剂.为研究二氢荆芥内酯的合成和性质,进行如下反应:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\\mathrm{CHO} \\xrightarrow [ \\text {acetone,0°C} ]{\\mathrm{CrO} _ {3} , \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{SO} _ {4}} \\mathrm{A} \\xrightarrow [ \\Delta ]{\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{OH} , \\mathrm{H} ^ {+}} \\mathrm{B}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\\xrightarrow [ \\text {peroxide} ]{\\mathrm{HBr}} \\mathrm{C} \\xrightarrow [ 2 . \\mathrm{H} ^ {+} , \\Delta ]{1 . \\mathrm{LiOH} , \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{OH}} \\mathrm{D} \\xrightarrow [ \\mathrm{THF} ]{\\mathrm{LiAlH} _ {4}} \\mathrm{E}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "写出A,B,C,D和E的结构简式(不考虑立体异构体)."
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-002402"
    }
  ],
